<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  PRODUCT_SPEC PLAY-002 — the headset action while the book is *actually* coming out of the headset.

  The state half of `ic_headset_output`; see `ic_car_output_active` for why the current output has to be
  said with an icon at all. This one matters more than the car's: a book held in a headset while a car is
  connected is the surprising state, and the question a driver has — *why is this not coming out of my
  car?* — is answered by seeing that the headset button is the lit one.

  The bar sits below a glyph scaled to 0.84. Material's `headset` fills the box to y=20, so at full size
  there is nowhere for a bar to go that does not touch it.
-->
